    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "GlobalFoundries’ Burlington Design Center, a 200‑mm wafer plant, opened in 1958 and grew to employ 8,000 workers by 1982, making it Vermont’s largest private employer.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
